    "*Lean on Me* (1989) was filmed primarily in **New Jersey**.\n\nWhile the movie is set at Eastside High School in Paterson, New Jersey, much of the actual filming took place at other locations to avoid disrupting the school day and to allow for more controlled filming environments. \n\nKey filming locations included:\n* **Passaic High School** in Passaic, New Jersey (which served as the primary stand-in for the interior and exterior of Eastside High).\n* Various other locations throughout the **Paterson and Passaic** areas to capture the urban atmosphere of the city.",
